{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/不朽•铁血开拓","pageid":6628,"revid":18808,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E2%80%A2%E9%93%81%E8%A1%80%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E2%80%A2%E9%93%81%E8%A1%80%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E2%80%A2%E9%93%81%E8%A1%80%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>不朽•铁血开拓</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E4.B8.8D.E6.9C.BD.E2.80.A2.E9.93.81.E8.A1.80.E5.BC.80.E6.8B.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"不朽•铁血开拓\"><b>不朽•铁血开拓</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 不朽•铁血开拓.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/i0n2dn040pm9jfvxc1we4gpvcie56ys.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E2%80%A2%E9%93%81%E8%A1%80%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/i0n2dn040pm9jfvxc1we4gpvcie56ys.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%8D%E6%9C%BD%E2%80%A2%E9%93%81%E8%A1%80%E5%BC%80%E6%8B%93.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/83/i0n2dn040pm9jfvxc1we4gpvcie56ys.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />不朽•铁血开拓\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1圈\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理攻击）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放枷锁</font></span></span>]，单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>伤害，施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">24</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"粉碎枷锁\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">粉碎枷锁</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼魔防2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合，并在目标身边召唤<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]；再使目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>圈内所有拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]的己方召唤物，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"战争杀器\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战争杀器</font></span></span>]，持续3回合；之后对范围内及本次召唤的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]进行攻击，使其触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不朽战骸\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">不朽战骸</font></span></span>]并随后[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">离场</span>]。若拥有下述[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]层数，则消耗对应层数并触发效果：拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层时，释放后额外召唤<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]。拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">20</font>层时，释放后额外召唤<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"帝国不朽军\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">帝国不朽军</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 1圈.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/30/mq0iz1d3i75wm0utwluun32e77eod2n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_1%E5%9C%88.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/30/mq0iz1d3i75wm0utwluun32e77eod2n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9F%BA%E5%AE%89%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/基安希尔\"><img alt=\"头像 基安希尔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/61/fl81fezqdtxw1h6zsryxqmfwsjh16v8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">基安希尔</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td